  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds typed dictionary sections across JSON, YAML, TOML, and INI using the existing APIs. Breaking changes: persisted dictionaries replace constructor entries, and empty INI sections represent empty objects or dictionaries. Mutable dictionary instances must implement System.Collections.IDictionary. Includes source-generated metadata and Native AOT verification. Release notes: https://github.com/zeekmeta/Confio/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
